OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity unveils new #100m
OL,4,Astudent village
OL,5,
OL,6,FA university has unveiled its new #100m
OL,7,Fstudent village which will provide 700
OL,8,Fnew and 300 refurbished bedrooms.
OL,10,FThe accommodation at the University of
OL,11,FStaffordshire comprises a mix of
OL,12,Fen-suite dormitories and town houses.
OL,14,FA "village hub" has also been built to
OL,15,Fprovide a wellbeing space, study areas,
OL,16,Fa rooftop terrace and a place to host
OL,17,Fevents.
OL,19,FExplorer and tv presenter Maj Levison
OL,20,FWood, chancellor at the university,
OL,21,Fsaid the new space would allow students
OL,22,Fto see the campus with "new eyes".
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
